repository is derived from software under a different licence. This file
records the boundary precisely, so that nobody has to guess at it.


1. MIT (LICENSE)
----------------

  src/                 the simulation models written for this work: the edge
                       aggregator and its admission gate, the health server,
                       the sensor rig, and the BLE / wired / WLAN sensor-link
                       models
