  analysis/figures_src/  figure scripts
  simulations/         scenario configurations

These are new modules written against the OMNeT++, INET and Simu5G APIs. They
are separate works that build and link against those frameworks; they do not
contain their code.


2. LGPL — derivative of Simu5G (NOT MIT)
----------------------------------------

